  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Blarney Stone** (1 other source): Uploader remembers balcony fans swinging beers and singing along to this song [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween1998-01-30.matrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 29 songs; 148 min [1]\n- **Ween1998-01-30**: source not stated; 29 songs; 146 min [2]\n- **ween1998-01-30.shnf**: source not stated; 29 songs; 139 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer treats the Philadelphia gig as a hometown show where the band pulled out extra energy for the local crowd [4]\n- Uploader attended; says the small Trocadero had great atmosphere and a wild crowd late in the Mollusk tour [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween1998-01-30.matrix**: source: Soundboard Cassette/Audience DAT (Matrix) [1]\n- **Ween1998-01-30**: Chain runs from an unknown audience recording to DAT, then CDR, EAC, WAV, a JWB remaster, FLAC, and CDR again [2]\n- **ween1998-01-30.shnf**: source: Schoeps MK4 > CMC3 Bodies> ? > EAC > WAV > SHN [3]. Also: Described as a soundboard/audience matrix, source unknown, then transferred via EAC to WAV and SHN, with another EAC to SHN by an archive.org user [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Ween - 1998-01-30 Trocadero Theatre, Philadelphia PA {20th Anniversary Matrix}](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2019/03/ween-1998-01-30-trocadero-theatre.html) [7]\n- Poster by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Ween - 1998-01-30 Trocadero Theatre, Philadelphia PA {20th Anniversary Matrix}](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2019/03/ween-1998-01-30-trocadero-theatre.html) [8]\n- Poster by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Ween - 1998-01-30 Trocadero Theatre, Philadelphia PA {20th Anniversary Matrix}](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2019/03/ween-1998-01-30-trocadero-theatre.html) [9]",
